# Hill Bomb rivals: three locals line up at the Dolores start line and push off at your speed as you
# cross it. Tucked all the way with no brakes (11.00 s) you beat them all: first of four; the race is
# over at your finish, so the racers go home without a time. You lead from the start line on.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run bomb
hold up 20..200
hold ollie 200..1600
run 1600
expect event bombStart within 255..270
expect session.racePlace == 0 at 200
expect session.racePlace == 1 at 600
expect session.racePlace == 1 at 1500
expect event bombFinish{route=dolores,place=1,of=4,time=11} within 1575..1590
expect no event racerFinish
expect no event bail
